Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs19\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(123.2,246.4)}Teach me, Fried Shrimp-san, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(176,284.8)}My name is Fried Shrimp-san. \NThat's what everyone calls me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I come to Earth 5,000 years ago? \NNo, 10,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.91,0:00:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, I'm an alien who came \Nto Earth for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I shed excess weight to match Earth's environmental changes, \Ntaking on the most suitable form, what you might call evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My original form? \NI've already forgotten about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have spent a long time on Earth, and because of that, \NI know everything about this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, it seems another troubled alien has come to visit, \Nrelying on my knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, Fried Shrimp-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(181.6,285.867)}I got a ticket to a luxury hotel buffet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've never been to a place like that, so I'm worried I might embarrass myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.70,0:00:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A luxury hotel buffet ticket, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, the very first thing you must do is check \Nwhether it's an invitation or a paid pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:01:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on the type of ticket, charges might apply, so you'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.88,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Fried Shrimp-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.73,0:01:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If your plate ends up entirely brown,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,don't panic, just add a single cherry tomato \Nand it'll work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.28,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A splash of color, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, if there's okra at the salad bar, \NI'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.68,0:01:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed! \NHaving okra amidst all those leafy greens really is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried Shrimp-san, \Nthank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ever have something else you don't understand, \Nfeel free to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Fried Shrimp-san. \NI know everything about Earth.
